sysCPUBusyGet OBJECT-TYPE
    SYNTAX  INTEGER
    MAX-ACCESS  read-only
    STATUS  current
    DESCRIPTION
        " CPU busy percentage in the last period. Not the last realtime but
        the last period in the scheduler."
    ::= { sysSlotEntry  4 }  
    
